This licence covers the wrapper written for this repository: `addons/pure_doom/src/`,
the GDScript under `addons/pure_doom/scripts/`, the scenes, resources and tests.

It does not cover the bundled DOOM engine. `addons/pure_doom/thirdparty/PureDOOM.h` is
Daivuk's port of the id Software DOOM source and is GPL 2.0; its terms are in
`addons/pure_doom/thirdparty/LICENSE`. The prebuilt libraries in `addons/pure_doom/bin/`
are compiled from it, so anything you distribute that links them is bound by that licence
too. `addons/pure_doom/assets/doom1.wad` is id Software's freely redistributable shareware
IWAD and is not MIT either. See the credits table in `addons/pure_doom/README.md`.
